cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, benchmark datasets, or findings in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Shadow AI Prompt Guardian — SENTINEL: A Zero-Trust Client-Side Data Loss Prevention (DLP) and Sensitive Data Interception System for Generative AI Platforms"
abstract: "SENTINEL is a client-side Data Loss Prevention (DLP) browser extension designed to protect sensitive credentials, API keys, Personally Identifiable Information (PII), and confidential trade secrets from being leaked into public and third-party AI platforms. Built on Manifest V3, SENTINEL intercepts prompts locally within the browser DOM and network capture phases, executing regex pattern matching, Shannon entropy calculation, and contextual risk scoring with zero external telemetry and zero data retention."
